    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "4b7131a1-d1db-45d8-a798-da101a34af95",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Can I Axe You A Question?",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121574851906",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ab66b3bf-d723-4819-8b67-1223c287901d).Image",
        "Description": "47, you may be wondering what is the similarity between some blind harpist and an old suited man with a bald spot. Well, on each of these five Providence members&apos; resumes, they all have a degree in melee weapons. A lot of people on the Isle do. However, these five are particularly focused on axes. So, we decided to put their knowledge to the test. If they couldn&apos;t answer a simple question about axes, they&apos;d be put down with their passion. They all answered incorrectly. You know what to do, 47.",
